Description: Face authentication using RGB or infrared cameras
 Face Unlock lets you sign in, unlock the screen and approve administrator
 prompts (including sudo) by looking at an RGB or infrared camera.
 Your password keeps working as a fallback at every prompt.
 .
 The package contains a GTK settings app to enroll faces and adjust
 recognition, a PAM module, and a bundled recognition engine based on
 Howdy and dlib. Face data is stored only on this computer.
 .
 Face recognition is a convenience feature and is less secure than a
 strong password.
